  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Empoza ya Pawulo mu Maaso ga Agulipa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agulipa n'agamba Pawulo nti, \"Okkirizibbwa okuwoza ensonga zo.\" Awo Pawulo n'agolola omukono gwe, n'awoza nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kabaka Agulipa, nnina omukisa okuwoleza mu maaso go leero, nga nnyanukula byonna Abayudaaya bye banvunaana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kubanga mmanyi ng'empisa z'Ekiyudaaya, zonna ozitegeera bulungi. Kyenva nkusaba ompulirize n'obugumiikiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nayigirizibwa n'obwegendereza mu mpisa z'Ekiyudaaya okuviira ddala mu buto bwange mu kibuga ky'ewaffe e Taluso ne mu Yerusaalemi, era ne ntambulira mu mpisa ezo obulamu bwange bwonna. Ebyo byonna Abayudaaya bonna babimanyi bulungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bammanyidde ebbanga ddene nnyo, singa babadde baagala bandinjulidde, nga ndi munnakibiina eky'Abafalisaayo, eky'omu ddiini yaffe ekisingira ddala okunonooza mu buli nsonga ey'Ekiyudaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakano nnyimiridde nga nvunaanibwa, kubanga nnina essuubi mu ebyo Katonda bye yasuubiza bajjajjaffe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebika byaffe ekkumi n'ebibiri bye basuubira okutuukako nga banyiikira okusinza emisana n'ekiro; era olw'essuubi eryo, ayi kabaka, Abayudaaya kyebavudde banvunaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiki ekibalowoozesa nti tekiyinzika Katonda okuzuukiza abafu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nze ku lwange nalowooza nti kiŋŋwanidde okuyigganya erinnya lya Yesu Omunnazaaleesi, n'obukambwe bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ntyo ne mbikola ne mu Yerusaalemi era ne nsiba abatuukirivu bangi mu makomera, era ne mpeebwa n'obuyinza okuva eri bakabona abakulu; abatukuvu ne bwe battibwanga, nga nkiwagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mu makuŋŋaaniro gonna wonna ne mbasindiikirizanga nga mbawalirizanga okuvvoola, ne mbasunguwaliranga nnyo, ne mbayigganyanga okutuuka ne mu bibuga eby'ewala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Awo bwe nnali nga ndaga e Damasiko, nga ndagiddwa era nga mpeereddwa obuyinza okuva eri bakabona abakulu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga ndi mu kkubo mu ttuntu, ayi Kabaka, ne ndaba ekitangaala ekyaka okusinga eky'enjuba, ne kinjakira ne bannange be nnali ntambula nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ffenna bwe twagwa wansi, ne mpulira eddoboozi nga liŋŋamba mu Lwebbulaniya nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Sawulo, Sawulo, onjigganyiza ki? Weerumya wekka bw'osamba ku nkato.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.26.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mbuuza nti, 'Ggwe ani Mukama wange?' Mukama waffe n'addamu nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Nze Yesu, gw'oyigganya.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.26.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Naye golokoka. Nkulabikidde, nkulonde obeere omuweereza wange era omujulirwa w'ebyo mw'ondabidde era ow'ebyo mwe nnaakulabikiranga.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Era ndikuwonya mu bantu bano ne mu baamawanga gye ndikutuma",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "okuzibula amaaso gaabwe bakyuke bave mu kizikiza badde eri omusana, n'okuva mu buyinza bwa Setaani, badde eri Katonda balyoke basonyiyibwe ebibi bafunire wamu omugabo gwa Katonda n'abo abatukuzibwa olw'okunzikiriza.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.26.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bwe ntyo, Ayi Kabaka Agulipa, ne sinyooma kwolesebwa okwo okwava mu ggulu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye ne nsookera ku b'omu Damasiko, ne nzizaako ab'omu Yerusaalemi ne mu Buyudaaya mwonna, n'eri Abaamawanga, nga mbategeeza beenenye bakyukire Katonda, era bakolenga ebikolwa eby'okwenenya ebisaanira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo y'ensonga Abayudaaya kyebaava bankwata nga ndi mu Yeekaalu ne bagezaako n'okunzita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda kyavudde ankuuma okutuusa leero ndyoke nyimirire nga ndi mujulirwa eri ab'ekitiibwa era n'aba bulijjo, nga sirina kirala kye njogera, wabula ebyo bannabbi ne Musa bye baategeeza nga bigenda okujja",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti Kristo kimugwanira okubonaabona, era abeere omubereberye mu kuzuukira kw'abafu, alyoke aleetere abantu bano n'Abamawanga omusana.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Pawulo bwe yali akyawoza Fesuto n'aleekaana mu ddoboozi ery'omwanguka nti, \"Pawulo, olaluse! Okusoma ennyo kukusudde eddalu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulo n'addamu nti, \"Siraluse, Oweekitiibwa Fesuto. Ebigambo bye njogera bya nsonga era bya mazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ebintu bino Kabaka Agulipa abitegeera, noolwekyo nnyinza okubimubuulira nga seekomoma. Era nkakasa nga tewali na kimu ku bintu bino ky'ataamanya, kubanga tebyakolerwa mu nkiso!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka Agulipa, bannabbi obakkiriza? Mmanyi ng'obakkiriza.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agulipa n'agamba Pawulo nti, \"Onsendasenda nfuuke Omukristaayo mu kaseera kano akatono bwe kati?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
